      "post": {
        "description": "Index one Markdown file for a tenant, so the copilot can retrieve it.\n\nThe file is split into chunks along its headings (each chunk keeps its heading path),\neach chunk is embedded, and the document, its Markdown and its chunks are stored in one\ntransaction. A document is identified by `tenant` + `source_key` (by default the file\nname): uploading it again replaces its previous version.\n\n**Idempotent.** If the content and the chunking and embedding settings are the same as\nthe stored version, nothing is done and the answer is `200 up_to_date`, without calling\nthe embedding provider. Send `force=true` to reindex anyway.\n\n| Status | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `201` | Indexed (new document, or a changed one). |\n| `200` | Already up to date: nothing was done. |\n| `401` | `X-API-Key` missing or wrong. |\n| `413` | The file is larger than `MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES` (default 5 MiB). |\n| `422` | Not a `.md` file, not UTF-8, empty, nothing to index, or an invalid field. |\n| `502` | The embedding provider failed after retries. Nothing was stored. |\n\nErrors use the API's error format (see the API description) and are told apart by\n`detail[].type`.",
        "operationId": "upload_document",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "multipart/form-data": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Body_upload_document"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "up_to_date": {
                    "summary": "Up to date",
                    "value": {
                      "doc_id": "upload-1890b5dc5335",
                      "status": "up_to_date"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IngestResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Already up to date: same content and settings, nothing was done."
          },
          "201": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "indexed": {
                    "summary": "Indexed",
                    "value": {
                      "chunk_count": 12,
                      "doc_id": "upload-1890b5dc5335",
                      "embed_signature": "17047d562b7e",
                      "embedding_model": "voyage-4",
                      "status": "indexed"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IngestResponse"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Indexed: the document was chunked, embedded and stored."
          },
          "401": {
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "examples": {
                  "invalid_api_key": {
                    "summary": "Missing or wrong key",
                    "value": {
                      "detail": [
                        {
